<view class="page"><view class="title">模拟订单详情</view><view class="notice">模拟支付，不会真实扣款；模拟发货不代表琴行已安排配送。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="refresh">重试</button><button bindtap="list">返回订单列表</button></view><block wx:if="{{order && !error}}"><view class="card"><view class="section-title">{{order.statusText}}</view><view class="muted break">{{order.id}}</view><view class="muted spaced">提交时间 {{order.createdAt}}</view><view wx:for="{{order.items}}" wx:key="skuId" class="order-line"><image class="order-image" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="order-info"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.label}} · ¥{{item.priceText}} × {{item.quantity}}</view><view>¥{{item.lineText}}</view></view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row"><text>商品小计</text><text>¥{{order.subtotalText}}</text></view><view class="row spaced"><text>运费</text><text>¥{{order.shippingText}}</text></view><view class="row spaced"><text>合计</text><text class="price">¥{{order.totalText}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">{{order.fulfillment === 'pickup' ? '到店自提' : '配送到家'}}</view><view>{{order.contact}} · {{order.phone}}</view><view wx:if="{{order.address}}" class="muted spaced">{{order.address.regionNames[0]}} {{order.address.regionNames[1]}} {{order.address.regionNames[2]}} {{order.address.detail}}</view><view class="muted spaced">待付款不预留库存。只有模拟付款成功才扣减本机库存。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">交付时间 · 纽约门店当地时间</view><block wx:if="{{order.desiredTime}}"><view>顾客期望：{{order.desiredTime.date}} {{order.desiredTime.time}}</view><view wx:if="{{order.confirmedTime}}" class="spaced">商家已确认：{{order.confirmedTime.date}} {{order.confirmedTime.time}}</view><view wx:if="{{!order.confirmedTime}}" class="muted spaced">待商家确认</view><view class="muted spaced">仅本机演示；不预留档期，配送时间不是运输到达承诺。</view></block><view wx:if="{{!order.desiredTime}}" class="muted">旧订单未填写期望时间</view><view wx:if="{{admin && order.status === 'paid' && order.desiredTime}}"><view class="muted spaced">确认原时间或调整后确认；原日期已过期时请重选。</view><view wx:if="{{timeError}}" class="error">{{timeError}}</view><picker range="{{dateOptions}}" bindchange="selectDate" disabled="{{saving || loading}}"><view class="picker spaced">{{confirmDate || '请选择日期'}}</view></picker><picker range="{{hourOptions}}" bindchange="selectHour" disabled="{{saving || loading}}"><view class="picker spaced">{{confirmHour || '请选择时间'}}</view></picker><button class="primary spaced" bindtap="confirmTime" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || loading || !!timeError}}">确认交付时间（本机模拟）</button></view></view><view class="order-actions"><button wx:if="{{order.status === 'pending'}}" bindtap="pay" class="primary" disabled="{{saving || loading}}">继续模拟付款</button><button wx:if="{{order.status === 'pending'}}" bindtap="status" data-status="cancelled" disabled="{{saving || loading}}">取消订单</button><button wx:if="{{admin && order.status === 'paid' && order.fulfillment === 'delivery'}}" bindtap="status" data-status="shipped" disabled="{{saving || loading || (order.desiredTime && !order.confirmedTime)}}">标记模拟发货</button><button wx:if="{{admin && order.status === 'paid' && order.fulfillment === 'pickup'}}" bindtap="status" data-status="completed" disabled="{{saving || loading || (order.desiredTime && !order.confirmedTime)}}">标记自提完成</button><button wx:if="{{order.status === 'shipped'}}" bindtap="status" data-status="completed" disabled="{{saving || loading}}">确认完成</button><button bindtap="list">返回订单列表</button></view></block></view>
